  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks two distinct things: whether there is a penalty/cost for unshipped goods, and whether the sole objective is minimizing containers. These are separate policy clarifications that could receive different answers."
}

{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "For the weight calculation, is the weight of a container simply the sum of (units × unit weight) of the goods packed in it, with no additional tare/empty-container weight to include?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains a single clarification question asking for confirmation of the weight calculation formula, specifically whether tare weight is excluded."
}

